<title>CHINA: Trading in China EB Int'l shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in China EB Int'l shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of China Everbright International Ltd was suspended at the company's request on Friday pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>The company's shares fell HK$0.30 to HK$5.30 on Thursday.</p>
<p>Brokers said it was rumoured the company was considering raising funds through a rights issue or share placement.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
